{:adr-id "2607997600"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-2592 — Treatment and Coating of Metals; Machining Plant-Operations Coordination Actor"
 :status :accepted
 :date "2026-07-15"
 :context
 "ISIC 2592 (Treatment and coating of metals; machining) had no repo
  (gh api repos/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-2592 confirmed 404
  before any work began; the registry's own :repo field pointed at a
  never-created gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-C2592 placeholder). Registry
  :name independently re-verified against a fresh Contents-API read:
  \"Treatment and coating of metals\" -- a truncated label consistent
  with sibling entries in the same ISIC 259 group (2591's own :name
  likewise drops its official \"; powder metallurgy\" suffix); the
  full official ISIC Rev.4 title is \"Treatment and coating of metals;
  machining\", matching the assigned class. Closest verified sibling
  is cloud-itonami-isic-2593 (Manufacture of cutlery, hand tools and
  general hardware) -- same back-office plant-operations coordination
  shape for a fixed manufacturing plant with heavy equipment and a
  real physical safety dimension, though 2592 is a surface-finishing/
  heat-treatment/machining JOB SHOP (fee-or-contract work on other
  manufacturers' parts) rather than a finished-goods shop."
 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-2592 mirroring cloud-itonami-isic-2593
  module-for-module: MetalTreatmentAdvisor ⊣ Metal Treatment, Coating &
  Machining Plant Operations Governor + append-only audit ledger,
  langgraph-clj StateGraph. Four ops (log-production-batch/
  schedule-maintenance/flag-safety-concern/coordinate-shipment), all
  :effect :propose only. Ten HARD governor checks: propose-only
  effect, closed op allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist,
  permanent plating/machining-line-actuate block
  (:actuate-plating-machining-line?), independent equipment/batch
  verified+registered gates, independent shipment-weight recompute,
  double-schedule guard, product-category validation (closed set
  electroplated-item/anodized-item/powder-coated-item/galvanized-item/
  heat-treated-item/machined-part-item), defect-rate plausibility
  validation. flag-safety-concern (electroplating-bath chemical
  toxicity -- cyanide/hexavalent-chromium/acid baths, CNC-machining
  swarf/cutting-tool laceration hazard, heat-treatment-furnace
  burn/radiant-heat exposure) always escalates regardless of
  confidence -- the domain-specific safety-concern vocabulary is the
  deliberate departure from 2593's sharp-edge-laceration/
  forging-hammer-pinch-crush/grinding-wheel-abrasive-dust vocabulary
  (this vertical treats/finishes/machines parts on contract, it does
  not forge/grind them). Fully portable .cljc, no JVM-only interop
  anywhere in src/; actor graph invoked exclusively via
  langgraph.graph/run*."
 :consequences
 ["Certified metal-treatment/coating/machining job-shop operators fork and deploy independently with auditable coordination records; direct plating/machining-line-equipment control and plating/machining-line actuation remain permanent, un-overridable HARD blocks"
  "Safety-concern flagging is a circuit-breaker, not a threshold -- always escalates to a human plant supervisor regardless of confidence"
  "kotoba-lang/industry registry entry \"2592\" promoted :spec -> :implemented, :repo/:business-id corrected from the stale gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-C2592 placeholder to cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-2592"
  "Still a simulation/proposal layer, not a real plant-operations control system -- no integration with real plant-management databases (equipment telemetry, batch tracking, freight dispatch)"]
